# LabVale - Security: Deny Script Execution in Uploads/Images Directory
<FilesMatch "(?i)\.(php|phtml|php3|php4|php5|php7|php8|phar|inc|pl|py|cgi|asp|js|sh)$">
    <IfModule mod_authz_core.c>
        Require all denied
    </IfModule>
    <IfModule !mod_authz_core.c>
        Order deny,allow
        Deny from all
    </IfModule>
</FilesMatch>

<IfModule mod_php.c>
    php_flag engine off
</IfModule>
<IfModule mod_php7.c>
    php_flag engine off
</IfModule>
<IfModule mod_php8.c>
    php_flag engine off
</IfModule>
